    "detailed_description": "<strong>Nimbit Frontier</strong> is a creature-collecting life-sim where you venture into the mysterious wilderness and return home to build habitats for creatures called Nimbits. You hatch the chicks by implanting their genetics into donor eggs, and care for them until they are ready for release into the wild.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hunt for rare species by searching in varying conditions<br></li><li>Care for Nimbits with different habitat demands<br></li><li>Earn permits to build habitat items by research, releases, or donations<br></li><li>Weather and time-of-day affects the wilderness<br></li><li>Upgrade your gear and buy improvements for the townsfolk<br></li><li>Take on greater threats with artifacts and charms<br></li><li>Decorate your house to get better sleep<br></li><li>Farm plants in the town nursery used to build unique habitats<br></li><li>Buy an assortment of bots to help care for the Nimbits<br></li><li>Befriend and romance villagers with personalities</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/b190e3efc3793ca3eda333f839ad7441.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/b190e3efc3793ca3eda333f839ad7441.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/6dd663d34bf0b1ae01b1b84161a2d995.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/6dd663d34bf0b1ae01b1b84161a2d995.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/229103fd16127ae58f65f912f1d7ee29.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/229103fd16127ae58f65f912f1d7ee29.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/157fc23a802d316b45539f11184671d5.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/157fc23a802d316b45539f11184671d5.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/be2a099332415c4ec6ab026d7e2d0ae2.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/be2a099332415c4ec6ab026d7e2d0ae2.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Nimbit Frontier</strong> is a creature-collecting life-sim where you venture into the mysterious wilderness and return home to build habitats for creatures called Nimbits. You hatch the chicks by implanting their genetics into donor eggs, and care for them until they are ready for release into the wild.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hunt for rare species by searching in varying conditions<br></li><li>Care for Nimbits with different habitat demands<br></li><li>Earn permits to build habitat items by research, releases, or donations<br></li><li>Weather and time-of-day affects the wilderness<br></li><li>Upgrade your gear and buy improvements for the townsfolk<br></li><li>Take on greater threats with artifacts and charms<br></li><li>Decorate your house to get better sleep<br></li><li>Farm plants in the town nursery used to build unique habitats<br></li><li>Buy an assortment of bots to help care for the Nimbits<br></li><li>Befriend and romance villagers with personalities</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/b190e3efc3793ca3eda333f839ad7441.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/b190e3efc3793ca3eda333f839ad7441.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/6dd663d34bf0b1ae01b1b84161a2d995.poster.avif?t=1750673008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/6dd663d34bf0b1ae01b1b84161a2d995.webm?t=1750673008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a